9. Serverless Image Resizer

Execution Steps
1.Create S3 bucket
2.Create Lambda function
3.Add image resize code
4.Configure S3 trigger
5.Upload image to bucket
6.Verify resized output image

Project Overview
Created a serverless solution to automatically resize uploaded images.

AWS Services Used
AWS Lambda
Amazon S3

Features
Automatic image processing
Event-driven architecture
Serverless computing

Architecture
Image Upload → S3 Trigger → Lambda → Resized Image
